{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Phantasmal Neon Island</strong>, the city that never sleeps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island lies <strong>Neon Street</strong>, a dazzling avenue filled with all kinds of nightclubs and entertainment venues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them is a long-established <strong>host club</strong>, built from your father\u2019s years of hard work. But after a sudden car accident, your father is hospitalized \u2014 and now <strong>you must take over the business</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as you step in, you face one crisis after another: hosts quitting, rent increases, mounting debt, and a ruthless landlord demanding payment. If you can\u2019t keep the shop profitable each month, you\u2019ll be forced to shut down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you balance <strong>management, romance, and adventure</strong>?<br>Will you become a legendary nightlife tycoon\u2026 or the ultimate \u201cQueen of the Night\u201d with multiple love interests?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything depends on <strong>your choices</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">QQ Group: 518885488<br>Xiaohongshu: \u5e7b\u9713\u7eee\u5c9b<br>bilibili: \u5e7b\u9713\u7eee\u5c9b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114520/extras/4c1b8623bfcef5fe18f009177f4c236f.avif?t=1761604154\" width=982 height=8192 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114520/extras/248d84b588383896b1f5f8dfa47ade6c.avif?t=1761604154\" width=768 height=8192 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4114520?t=1761604154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114520/c76a345068928195c399b73e7bc